WEBVTT

00:13.481 --> 00:19.565
The storm is over now, the static's gone Right

00:19.645 --> 00:26.129
here is where you've been all along Your voice

00:26.169 --> 00:29.971
was lost, your world was grey We're here to chase

00:30.011 --> 00:33.253
the dark away You walked through fire, you

00:33.293 --> 00:36.875
walked through rain But you will never walk

00:36.975 --> 00:39.557
alone again

00:41.512 --> 00:49.296
We are your sanctuary in the storm A fire here to

00:49.356 --> 00:55.660
keep you safe and warm Inside this circle held so

00:55.720 --> 00:59.342
tight We'll be your true and gentle light So let

00:59.382 --> 01:03.784
the painted smile fall down You're standing on

01:03.824 --> 01:09.848
your native ground Your home

01:12.921 --> 01:14.402
You're finally home

01:20.868 --> 01:25.770
The last few words on the floor You don't need it

01:25.950 --> 01:30.051
anymore The silence has no power here We'll

01:30.091 --> 01:35.413
banish every single fear Just let it go The heavy

01:35.473 --> 01:39.655
load at the ending of this lonely road Just lean

01:39.735 --> 01:44.077
on us, we'll hold the line Your broken heart will

01:44.117 --> 01:45.457
mend, we'll tell

01:52.376 --> 01:56.821
We are your sanctuary and your storm

02:04.460 --> 02:09.782
A father here to keep you safe and warm Inside

02:09.822 --> 02:14.765
this circle held so tight Will be your true and

02:14.805 --> 02:18.967
gentle light So let the painted smile fall down

02:19.027 --> 02:25.129
You're standing on your native ground You're

02:25.249 --> 02:26.910
home

02:29.671 --> 02:32.833
You're finally home

03:12.839 --> 03:15.842
You're home You're

03:19.044 --> 03:19.144
fine

03:24.289 --> 03:29.156
We are your sanctuary You're not alone

